  "html": "<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col col-8\"><h2>IR Thermoplastic Panel Preheater</h2><figure><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-IR-Preheater-b.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><div class=\"center\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\n<li>Pre-heats blanks up to 24” x 24” (610 mm x 610 mm)</li>\n<li>IR heating of blanks</li>\n<li>System integrated with 150 ton press</li>\n<li>Tool heating &amp; cooling</li>\n<li>Automatic blank insertion &amp; part ejection</li>\n<li>4 inch/sec (102 mm/sec) closing rate</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div><div class=\"col col-4\">\n\t\t\t<nav class=\"side-nav\"><h3 class=\"widget-title\">Forming / Compaction / Debulking</h3><ul><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/forming-compaction-debulking/stringer-forming-and-trim-cell/\">Stringer Former and Trim Cell</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/forming-compaction-debulking/stringer-former-i/\">Stringer Former I</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/forming-compaction-debulking/stringer-former-ii/\">Stringer Former II</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/forming-compaction-debulking/stringer-former-iii/\">Stringer Former III</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/forming-compaction-debulking/hot-drape-forming/\">Hot Drape Forming</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/forming-compaction-debulking/forming-on-contoured-surfaces/\">Forming on Contoured Surfaces</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/forming-compaction-debulking/automated-debulking-machine/\">Automated Debulking Machine</a></li><li class=\"current\"><a href=\"/composites-automation/forming-compaction-debulking/ir-thermoplastic-panel-preheater/\">IR Thermoplastic Panel Preheater</a></li></ul></nav>\n</div></div><h3>Machine Images</h3><div class=\"gallery\"><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-IR-Preheater-a.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-IR-Preheater-a-300x232.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"232\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-IR-Preheater-b.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-